{"5066980": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Deep Trouble", "steam_appid": 5066980, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 1–6 player co-op sub adventure into the depths of leviathan infested waters. Leave your sub to swim, scavenge and carry physics salvage back to survive the journey. Watch out for feral creatures and deadly hazards as you venture into the unexplored deep. Will you discover what lies at the bottom?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066980/extras/91664df4fa76cadda7c3bf88a340b321.poster.avif?t=1787596899\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066980/extras/91664df4fa76cadda7c3bf88a340b321.webm?t=1787596899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066980/extras/91664df4fa76cadda7c3bf88a340b321.mp4?t=1787596899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HOME SWEET SUB</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your trusty sub will keep you and your friends safe! Pilot it through the depths as a mobile home to return to, just make sure you keep it stocked with oxygen, battery and revive fish. Take care of it and it'll take care of you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066980/extras/656ae090f9e74f91f56ee6fe0ef2431f.poster.avif?t=1787596899\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066980/extras/656ae090f9e74f91f56ee6fe0ef2431f.webm?t=1787596899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066980/extras/656ae090f9e74f91f56ee6fe0ef2431f.mp4?t=1787596899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SCAVENGE THE ENVIRONMENT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can't stay in the sub forever! Swim and search for resources, upgrades and items. Smaller items can be used in your hands or carried back to the sub, but larger items need you to work together and use the sub's dredge hook to reel them in. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066980/extras/765921212dc208b1c28db3018984aca9.poster.avif?t=1787596899\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066980/extras/765921212dc208b1c28db3018984aca9.webm?t=1787596899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066980/extras/765921212dc208b1c28db3018984aca9.mp4?t=1787596899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WORK TOGETHER TO SURVIVE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No diver should go it alone! You'll need to rely on your friends to collect items, solve challenges, for oxygen and ultimately to survive the depths. In the likely event of death, bring your friends' bodies back to the sub to revive them and keep diving. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066980/extras/2202a01509b530073ff2727fddeea849.poster.avif?t=1787596899\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066980/extras/2202a01509b530073ff2727fddeea849.webm?t=1787596899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066980/extras/2202a01509b530073ff2727fddeea849.mp4?t=1787596899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPLORE THE DEPTHS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The surface is only the beginning! The deeper you go, the more hostile the environment. Creatures, hazards and oxygen will challenge your dive. Uncover the mysteries and use what you discover along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066980/extras/cd58726822f5e89eb6b07ad51cff9941.poster.avif?t=1787596899\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066980/extras/cd58726822f5e89eb6b07ad51cff9941.webm?t=1787596899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066980/extras/cd58726822f5e89eb6b07ad51cff9941.mp4?t=1787596899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BRING YOUR CREW</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is you and your friends journey! Deep Trouble is for friend groups - make it yours by customizing your character and sub. Prove and show off your skills with tons of achievements to unlock and cosmetics to earn. Dives are made for groups, but going solo is possible and is the ultimate challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066980/extras/2ea8808ea23ba92c7218df6a17756638.poster.avif?t=1787596899\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066980/extras/2ea8808ea23ba92c7218df6a17756638.webm?t=1787596899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066980/extras/2ea8808ea23ba92c7218df6a17756638.mp4?t=1787596899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with up to 6 friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pilot a submarine </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend through 4 distinct ocean </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swim and collect physics based loot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reel in large loot with the sub's dredge hook</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover and use a variety of items </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use and avoid the ecosystem of creatures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the threats of the massive leviathans </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the secrets hidden at the darkest depths!</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 1–6 player co-op sub adventure into the depths of leviathan infested waters. Leave your sub to swim, scavenge and carry physics salvage back to survive the journey. Watch out for feral creatures and deadly hazards as you venture into the unexplored deep. Will you discover what lies at the bottom?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066980/extras/91664df4fa76cadda7c3bf88a340b321.poster.avif?t=1787596899\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066980/extras/91664df4fa76cadda7c3bf88a340b321.webm?t=1787596899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066980/extras/91664df4fa76cadda7c3bf88a340b321.mp4?t=1787596899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HOME SWEET SUB</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your trusty sub will keep you and your friends safe! Pilot it through the depths as a mobile home to return to, just make sure you keep it stocked with oxygen, battery and revive fish. Take care of it and it'll take care of you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066980/extras/656ae090f9e74f91f56ee6fe0ef2431f.poster.avif?t=1787596899\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066980/extras/656ae090f9e74f91f56ee6fe0ef2431f.webm?t=1787596899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066980/extras/656ae090f9e74f91f56ee6fe0ef2431f.mp4?t=1787596899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SCAVENGE THE ENVIRONMENT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can't stay in the sub forever! Swim and search for resources, upgrades and items. Smaller items can be used in your hands or carried back to the sub, but larger items need you to work together and use the sub's dredge hook to reel them in. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066980/extras/765921212dc208b1c28db3018984aca9.poster.avif?t=1787596899\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066980/extras/765921212dc208b1c28db3018984aca9.webm?t=1787596899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066980/extras/765921212dc208b1c28db3018984aca9.mp4?t=1787596899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WORK TOGETHER TO SURVIVE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No diver should go it alone! You'll need to rely on your friends to collect items, solve challenges, for oxygen and ultimately to survive the depths. In the likely event of death, bring your friends' bodies back to the sub to revive them and keep diving. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066980/extras/2202a01509b530073ff2727fddeea849.poster.avif?t=1787596899\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066980/extras/2202a01509b530073ff2727fddeea849.webm?t=1787596899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066980/extras/2202a01509b530073ff2727fddeea849.mp4?t=1787596899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPLORE THE DEPTHS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The surface is only the beginning! The deeper you go, the more hostile the environment. Creatures, hazards and oxygen will challenge your dive. Uncover the mysteries and use what you discover along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066980/extras/cd58726822f5e89eb6b07ad51cff9941.poster.avif?t=1787596899\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066980/extras/cd58726822f5e89eb6b07ad51cff9941.webm?t=1787596899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066980/extras/cd58726822f5e89eb6b07ad51cff9941.mp4?t=1787596899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BRING YOUR CREW</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is you and your friends journey! Deep Trouble is for friend groups - make it yours by customizing your character and sub. Prove and show off your skills with tons of achievements to unlock and cosmetics to earn. Dives are made for groups, but going solo is possible and is the ultimate challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066980/extras/2ea8808ea23ba92c7218df6a17756638.poster.avif?t=1787596899\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066980/extras/2ea8808ea23ba92c7218df6a17756638.webm?t=1787596899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066980/extras/2ea8808ea23ba92c7218df6a17756638.mp4?t=1787596899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with up to 6 friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pilot a submarine </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend through 4 distinct ocean </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swim and collect physics based loot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reel in large loot with the sub's dredge hook</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover and use a variety of items </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use and avoid the ecosystem of creatures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the threats of the massive leviathans </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the secrets hidden at the darkest depths!</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "A 1–6 player co-op sub adventure into the depths of leviathan infested waters. Leave your sub to swim, scavenge and carry physics salvage back to survive the journey. Watch out for feral creatures and deadly hazards as you venture into the unexplored deep. Will you discover what lies at the bottom?", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066980/c38454bfd2d1baa9d9ba1ee62b711a359145b3c3/header.jpg?t=1787596899", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066980/dcebdc4b8391c17098348314169151db58edc43e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787596899", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066980/dcebdc4b8391c17098348314169151db58edc43e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787596899", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Win 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 @ 2.5 GHz or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1060 or RX 6600 XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Win 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 @ 3.0 GHz or AMD Ryzen 5 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong>  RTX 2060 or RX 7600xt or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "developers": ["Mini Kaiju Games"], "publishers": ["Mini Kaiju Games"], "package_grou